{"id":"CVE-2008-5410","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2008-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-07T10:49:12.528Z","description":"The PK11_SESSION cache in the OpenSSL PKCS#11 engine in Sun Solaris 10 does not maintain reference counts for operations with asymmetric keys, which allows context-dependent attackers to cause a denial of service (failed cryptographic operations) via unspecified vectors, related to the (1) RSA_sign and (2) RSA_verify functions.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-21-138863-02-1","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/47137","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_XF"],"name":"solaris-openssl-pkcs11engine-dos(47137)"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/32671","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"32671"},{"url":"http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-21-139459-01-1","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/3372","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_VUPEN"],"name":"ADV-2008-3372"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/33050","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"33050"},{"url":"http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-246846-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUNALERT"],"name":"246846"},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1021358","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1021358"},{"url":"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5914","tags":["vdb-entry","signature","x_refsource_OVAL"],"name":"oval:org.mitre.oval:def:5914"}],"vendors":["openssl"]}
{"id":"CVE-2008-7270","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2010-12-06T22:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-07T12:03:36.415Z","description":"OpenSSL before 0.9.8j, when SSL_OP_NETSCAPE_REUSE_CIPHER_CHANGE_BUG is enabled, does not prevent modification of the ciphersuite in the session cache, which allows remote attackers to force the use of a disabled cipher via vectors involving sniffing network traffic to discover a session identifier, a different vulnerability than CVE-2010-4180.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://cvs.openssl.org/chngview?cn=17489","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/42493","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"42493"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/522176","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_HP"],"name":"SSRT100817"},{"url":"http://ubuntu.com/usn/usn-1029-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-1029-1"},{"url":"http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=132077688910227&w=2","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_HP"],"name":"HPSBHF02706"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=659462","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45254","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"45254"},{"url":"http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0977.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2010:0977"},{"url":"http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0978.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2010:0978"},{"url":"http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0896.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2011:0896"}],"vendors":["openssl"]}
{"id":"CVE-2008-7278","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2011-03-18T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-09-16T17:04:10.628Z","description":"The S/MIME feature in Open Ticket Request System (OTRS) before 2.2.5, and 2.3.x before 2.3.0-beta1, does not properly configure the RANDFILE environment variable for OpenSSL, which might make it easier for remote attackers to decrypt e-mail messages that had lower than intended entropy available for cryptographic operations, related to inability to write to the seeding file.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://bugs.otrs.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2539","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://bugs.otrs.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2844","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://source.otrs.org/viewvc.cgi/otrs/CHANGES?revision=1.1807","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["openssl"]}
